# Normalise line endings.
#
# Prettier is configured with endOfLine: "lf" (.prettierrc.json). On Windows,
# core.autocrlf=true rewrites files to CRLF on checkout, so `prettier --check`
# reports every file as unformatted locally while CI on Linux passes — the
# repository content is LF either way. That divergence is pure noise and hides
# real formatting failures, so pin the working tree to LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files must never be normalised.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.tar.gz binary
*.zip binary

# Generated; keep out of diffs and language stats.
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true -diff
